  # 🚀 ZProximity Engine
  **The Physics of Attraction for the Modern Web.**
  
  [![NPM Downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dt/z-proximity-engine?color=black&style=for-the-badge)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/z-proximity-engine)
